Extra:
Example: 
```java
ClassLoader child = new URLClassLoader(new URL[]{...}, getClass().getClassLoader());
// child first asks parent before loading
```

Example: 
```java
URL[] urls = {new URL("file:/path/to/lib.jar")};
URLClassLoader loader = new URLClassLoader(urls);
Class<?> clazz = loader.loadClass("com.example.LibClass");
```
